OL,3,GNEWSARazors and dirty equipment found
OL,4,Aat care home
OL,5,
OL,6,FA care home in Nottinghamshire has been
OL,7,Frated as inadequate and placed in
OL,8,Fspecial measures after inspectors found
OL,9,F"significant shortfalls".
OL,11,FEden Lodge Residential Care Home in
OL,12,FBestwood Village was found to be "not
OL,13,Fconsistently safe, effective,
OL,14,Fresponsive or well-led" during a Care
OL,15,FQuality Commission (CQC) visit in July.
OL,17,FA report said "governance and oversight
OL,18,Fwere ineffective", with unsecured and
OL,19,Fdirty furniture, razors left in
OL,20,Fbedrooms, equipment contaminated with
OL,21,Ffaeces and some residents not receiving
OL,22,Fmedicines as prescribed.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
